### Medical Diagnosis API Test Requests

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7134
@baseUrlHttp = http://localhost:5134

### Get API Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnosis/status

### Get Available Symptoms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnosis/symptoms

### Predict Disease - Cardiovascular Example
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnosis/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 55,
  "weight": 85,
  "glucoseLevel": 140,
  "insulinLevel": 30,
  "smokingHabit": "yes",
  "symptoms": ["chest_pain", "shortness_breath", "fatigue"],
  "systolicBP": 150,
  "diastolicBP": 95,
  "heartRate": 90,
  "spO2": 95,
  "temperature": 36.8,
  "sleepQuality": "fair",
  "sleepDuration": 6.5,
  "activitySteps": 4000,
  "activityCalories": 1800,
  "respiratoryRate": 18,
  "stressLevel": "high"
}

### Test 1: Diabetes-like symptoms (should predict Diabetes)
POST {{baseUrlHttp}}/api/diagnosis/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 42,
  "weight": 78,
  "glucoseLevel": 200,
  "insulinLevel": 30,
  "smokingHabit": "no",
  "symptoms": ["blurred_vision", "frequent_urination", "thirst"],
  "systolicBP": 125,
  "diastolicBP": 80,
  "heartRate": 75,
  "spO2": 99,
  "temperature": 36.5,
  "sleepQuality": "good",
  "sleepDuration": 7.0,
  "activitySteps": 6000,
  "activityCalories": 2200,
  "respiratoryRate": 16,
  "stressLevel": "moderate"
}

