### Train ML Model
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnosis/train

### =====================================
### FRONTEND-OPTIMIZED ENDPOINTS (V2)
### =====================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/symptoms/health

### Get Symptom Categories (for UI organization)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/symptoms/categories

### Search Symptoms (for autocomplete)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/symptoms/search?query=head

### Simple Symptom Analysis (optimized for frontend)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/symptoms/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 35,
  "gender": "female",
  "symptoms": [
    {
      "name": "headache",
      "severity": "moderate",
      "duration": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "nausea",
      "severity": "mild",
      "duration": 2
    }
  ],
  "additionalInfo": "Started after stressful work week"
}

### Triage Assessment (urgency evaluation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/symptoms/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 45,
  "gender": "male",
  "symptoms": [
    {
      "name": "chest_pain",
      "severity": "severe",
      "duration": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "shortness_breath",
      "severity": "moderate",
      "duration": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Comprehensive Health Assessment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/symptoms/comprehensive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 28,
  "gender": "female",
  "weight": 65,
  "height": 165,
  "symptoms": [
    {
      "name": "fatigue",
      "severity": "moderate",
      "duration": 14
    },
    {
      "name": "joint_pain",
      "severity": "mild",
      "duration": 7
    }
  ],
  "existingConditions": ["hypothyroidism"],
  "medications": ["levothyroxine"],
  "smokingStatus": "never",
  "activityLevel": "moderate",
  "familyHistory": "Autoimmune conditions in family"
}

